NesPrgRom:9FD6:OvhdLvl8_ChunkDescTable:144 ChunkDesc records — the level's Chunk definitions, each a 2×2 quad of Structures. These are the indices OvhdLvl8_MapData's grid holds.
NesPrgRom:A216:OvhdLvl8_MapData:32×32 chunk-index grid = 1024 bytes
NesPrgRom:A616:OvhdLvl8_ScrollData:16 bytes — 8 B vertical + 8 B horizontal scroll-boundary flags
NesPrgRom:A626:OvhdLvl8_TileAttrTable:Tile attribute table – bits: 0-1=palette 2=walk-behind 3=Tunnel(→Tank) 4=damage 7=solid  3+7=Doorway 6+7=destroyable
NesPrgRom:A671:OvhdLvl4_MapPointers:Overhead level 4 (internal index 12) map pointer table (6×16-bit LE ptrs): BgPalette, TileAttr, TileDesc, StructureDesc, ChunkDesc, MapData
NesPrgRom:A67D:OvhdLvl4_BgPalette:4 BgPalette records — the level's 4 background sub-palettes × 4 NES colour indices.
NesPrgRom:A68D:OvhdLvl4_TileDescTable:96 TileDesc records — the level's Tile (USB) definitions. NOTE: OvhdLvl4_TileAttrTable is only 94 bytes, so the last 2 record(s) here have no attribute byte — either spare slots or a label boundary that needs narrowing (unresolved).
NesPrgRom:A80D:OvhdLvl4_StructureDescTable:132 StructureDesc records — the level's Structure definitions, each a 2×2 quad of Tiles.
NesPrgRom:AA1D:OvhdLvl4_ChunkDescTable:108 ChunkDesc records — the level's Chunk definitions, each a 2×2 quad of Structures. These are the indices OvhdLvl4_MapData's grid holds.
