NesPrgRom:1CDD0:ScreenFade_Step:Per-frame palette-wipe animator;\n\nif bit 7 of ScreenFade_Flags ($15) set: DEC ScreenFade_Counter ($B6, 8→0, fade-in);\nif bit 6 set: INC $B6 (0→9, fade-out);\n\neach step subtracts $B6×8 from $0650–$066F palette shadow
NesPrgRom:1CDD2::bits 6 and 7
NesPrgRom:1CDD4::Neither bit set, so abort.
NesPrgRom:1CDE0::is completly faded out?
