NesPrgRom:1E0A5:Obj_MoveAndCollide_Double:Double-speed Obj_MoveAndCollide: Apply_Double_Velocity_X + H_Collision_Check → $9A bit7 (side wall); Apply_Double_Velocity_Y + V_Collision_Check → bit6 (floor/ceiling); returns $9A. Dispatch slot $C030; used by the overhead projectile handlers (Slider Laser $53, Spitter Shot $55, Th2C Shot $57) and in-bank by Obj_MoveBounce_Double ($DF84).
NesPrgRom:1E0B2:_Obj_MoveAndCollide_Double__NoWallX:No side wall: X flag = 0.
NesPrgRom:1E0B4:_Obj_MoveAndCollide_Double__StoreX:$9A = side-wall flag (bit7).
NesPrgRom:1E0C4:_Obj_MoveAndCollide_Double__Return:Copy result (TerrainCollisionFlags) into A and return
NesPrgRom:1E0C7:Obj_ScaleVelY:Scale LoadedObj's Velocity_Y by the fraction in A.\n\nInput:\n  A = fraction, unsigned byte, in any fixed-point format.\n  LoadedObj's Velocity_Y = signed\n\nOutput:\n  A = LoadedObj's Velocity_Y scaled by A\n  LoadedObj's Velocity_Y = same as A
