NesPrgRom:1E1CF::Save into LoadedObj.Velocity_Y
NesPrgRom:1E1D2:Trig_CosByAngle:Cosine of the angle in A.\nImplemented as the sine of (A + $40)\n\nInput:\n  A = angle (0-255 = full circle)\n\nOutput:\n  A = signed magnitude (0..$7F)
NesPrgRom:1E1D3::cos(A) = sin(A + $40), so bias by a quarter-circle ($40) and\nfall into Trig_SinByAngle...
NesPrgRom:1E1D5:Trig_SinByAngle:___\n\nSine of the angle in A\n\nInput:\n  A = angle (0-255 = full circle)\n\nOutput:\n  A = signed magnitude (0..$7F)\n\nHandled as 1 of 4 possible cases:\n  +---------+---------------+--------+---------------+---------+\n  | A       | Quadrant      | Half   | A'            | Look-up |\n  |---------+---------------+--------+---------------+---------|\n  | $00–$3F | Q1 (0–90°)    | first  | A' = A        | as-is   |\n  | $40–$7F | Q2 (90–180°)  | first  | A' = $80 - A  | as-is   |\n  | $80–$BF | Q3 (180–270°) | second | A' = A - $80  | negated |\n  | $C0–$FF | Q4 (270–360°) | second | A' = -A       | negated |\n  +---------+---------------+--------+---------------+---------+
NesPrgRom:1E1D7::if A < $40, then handle as Quandrant 1
NesPrgRom:1E1DB::if A >= $80, then handle as Half 2 (negative)
NesPrgRom:1E1DD:_Trig_SinByAngle__Quandrant_2:if $40 <= A < $80, then handle as Quandrant 2 by\n1. converting A to Q1 equivalent (A = $80 - A), and\n2. falling into Q1 handler.
NesPrgRom:1E1E4:_Trig_SinByAngle__Quandrant_1:A < $40: Quadrant 1.\n\nA used as-is.\nLook-up used as-is.
NesPrgRom:1E1E9:_Trig_SinByAngle__Half_2
NesPrgRom:1E1EB::if A >= $C0, then handle as Quandrant 4
NesPrgRom:1E1ED:_Trig_SinByAngle__Quandrant_3:if $80 <= A < $C0, then handle as Quandrant 3 by\n1. setting A = A - $80, and\n2. Doing the table look-up and negating the result
NesPrgRom:1E1F3:_Trig_SinByAngle__Quandrant_4:if A >= $C0, then handle as Quandrant 4 by\n1. negating A, and\n2. Doing the table look-up and negating the result
NesPrgRom:1E1F8:_Trig_SinByAngle__LookupNeg:Get Look-up value and return it negated.
