NesInternalRam:0600:SpriteStagingBuf_Sprite0__ScreenY:Screen Y minus 1 (the PPU renders a sprite on the scanline AFTER this value). $EF..$FF puts the sprite off-screen, which is how OAM_HideAll ($EC61) hides one.
NesInternalRam:0601:SpriteStagingBuf_Sprite0__Tile:Pattern-table tile index. In 8x16 sprite mode bit 0 selects the pattern table ($0000/$1000) and bits 7-1 are the tile pair, which is why the overhead section's CHR banks are assigned in even/odd pairs.
NesInternalRam:0602:SpriteStagingBuf_Sprite0__Attr:Attribute byte: bits 0-1 sprite palette, bit 5 priority (behind background), bit 6 horizontal flip, bit 7 vertical flip. Built by the metasprite renderer as ($44 & $C3) EOR ctrl, so the def's per-tile ctrl bits contribute the flips and the palette EOR.
NesInternalRam:0603:SpriteStagingBuf_Sprite0__ScreenX:Screen X, left edge.
NesInternalRam:0604:SpriteStagingBuf_Sprite1__ScreenY:Screen Y minus 1 (the PPU renders a sprite on the scanline AFTER this value). $EF..$FF puts the sprite off-screen, which is how OAM_HideAll ($EC61) hides one.
NesInternalRam:0605:SpriteStagingBuf_Sprite1__Tile:Pattern-table tile index. In 8x16 sprite mode bit 0 selects the pattern table ($0000/$1000) and bits 7-1 are the tile pair, which is why the overhead section's CHR banks are assigned in even/odd pairs.
NesInternalRam:0606:SpriteStagingBuf_Sprite1__Attr:Attribute byte: bits 0-1 sprite palette, bit 5 priority (behind background), bit 6 horizontal flip, bit 7 vertical flip. Built by the metasprite renderer as ($44 & $C3) EOR ctrl, so the def's per-tile ctrl bits contribute the flips and the palette EOR.
NesInternalRam:0607:SpriteStagingBuf_Sprite1__ScreenX:Screen X, left edge.
