NesInternalRam:0609:SpriteStagingBuf_Sprite2__Tile:Pattern-table tile index. In 8x16 sprite mode bit 0 selects the pattern table ($0000/$1000) and bits 7-1 are the tile pair, which is why the overhead section's CHR banks are assigned in even/odd pairs.
